Cell["\<\
The coefficients inv1,...,inv5 are determined by imposing M0 M0Inverse = I on \
symmetric connection tensors. In the all-raised representation the identity \
is eta^{ae}(eta^{bf}eta^{cg}+eta^{bg}eta^{cf})/2. The index replacements \
lower and rename the three contracted slots; the six remaining indices are \
free. SolveConstants sets the full tensor residual to zero.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"10850545-19ff-49ea-be54-4f177dc45ab1"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

