Cell["\<\
As discussed in the paper, it is believed that the difference in surface term \
is due to an implicit integration by parts by CLM. This can be seen by \
comparing both actions written in terms of the complete Goldberg metric.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0011684900634823`*^9, 4.001168545866476*^9}, {
  4.0011685925333223`*^9, 4.0011686939155083`*^9}, {4.001168797776142*^9, 
